<https://ontology.surveillancegraph.org/vocab/predicate/1.0.0/camera_operator> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Operator of a registry-listed camera as evidenced by an authoritative operator field (the target's operator key or a feature operator attribute). P32.3 / ADR-122: the registry's publisher label is NOT operator evidence — it lands on `camera_registry_publisher` instead (categorical)." .
