<https://ontology.surveillancegraph.org/vocab/predicate/1.0.0/camera_registry_publisher> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The organisation that published this camera-registry artifact — registry PUBLISHER provenance, not an operational role. P32.3 / ADR-122 (SIG-TRUST-003): a publisher label never evidences camera operation, ownership, vendor or access status, and never mints an organisation entity-ref (the OSM contributor label is the canonical case)." .
