<https://ontology.surveillancegraph.org/vocab/predicate/1.0.0/count_scope> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Qualifier: the comparability scope a count claim is asserted at (e.g. metro, city_limits, jurisdiction, statewide). P32.3 / SIG-TRUST-004: counts in different scopes answer different questions — they are retained separately and never adjudicated against each other (a scope mismatch is not a contradiction)." .
<https://ontology.surveillancegraph.org/vocab/predicate/1.0.0/count_scope> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://ontology.surveillancegraph.org/vocab/predicate/1.0.0> .
