<https://ontology.surveillancegraph.org/vocab/predicate/1.0.0/count_scope_detail> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Qualifier: the refinement inside a count_scope (e.g. privately_owned, partner_agency, agency_operated). Two counts differ on detail at the same scope label are still different questions (P32.3 / SIG-TRUST-004)." .
