<https://ontology.surveillancegraph.org/vocab/predicate/1.0.0/distributes_list_to> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "§12.3 integration edge: A pushes a watchlist to B for local matching; matches do NOT return to A (one-way list, no feedback — MUST NOT be modelled as federates_search_to, SIG-ONTO-046). Carrier of 'automated alerts' in the twelve-power-properties map (SIG-ONTO-051)." .
