<https://ontology.surveillancegraph.org/vocab/predicate/1.0.0/physical_removed_from_street> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The world event of a physical surveillance asset being removed from the street — reserved lifecycle vocabulary named by the OSM connector but never inferred from a map deletion: osm_element_deleted (a mapping event) is the only claim a snapshot diff may emit; removal in the world needs its own evidence. Registered so the id is governed vocabulary, not an unowned literal." .
