<https://ontology.surveillancegraph.org/vocab/predicate/1.0.0/programme_area> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://ontology.surveillancegraph.org/vocab/predicate/1.0.0/programme_area> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A published programme-area aggregate subject assertion (the register's own row for one grouping column of a camera-related programme aggregate table — DC's PSA). The subject is the published area bucket the operator groups its programme counts by, never a camera device, a geometry, a registrant, a name, or an address (P36.7 / R11-ACQ-11)." .
<https://ontology.surveillancegraph.org/vocab/predicate/1.0.0/programme_area> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://ontology.surveillancegraph.org/vocab/predicate/1.0.0> .
<https://ontology.surveillancegraph.org/vocab/predicate/1.0.0/programme_area> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "programme_area"@en .
