<https://ontology.surveillancegraph.org/vocab/predicate/1.0.0/published_by> <https://ontology.surveillancegraph.org/schema/valueDatatype> "string" .
<https://ontology.surveillancegraph.org/vocab/predicate/1.0.0/published_by> <https://ontology.surveillancegraph.org/schema/volatilityClass> "GLACIAL" .
