<https://ontology.surveillancegraph.org/vocab/predicate/1.0.0/quantities> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Quantities a contract states for its products (§11.11); a stated quantity, never a deployed count." .
<https://ontology.surveillancegraph.org/vocab/predicate/1.0.0/quantities> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://ontology.surveillancegraph.org/vocab/predicate/1.0.0> .
